{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing plugin dispatch-order contract.** `PluginRunner` previously documented that every event hook runs in registration order, so reversing only `onInvocationEnd` changes observable behavior for existing multi-plugin configurations in 2.2.2. Keep legacy ordering, or introduce an opt-in/versioned scope-cleanup mechanism whose participating callbacks explicitly unwind in reverse.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77KBd4","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"189fda81d57eb784104350d589420073fca8f9709b857ca521700feb0941b800","observation_id":"aro_v1_dcp5vaovp23yiecdkdkysqqaop","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-08T01:29:24Z","review_id":"arr_v1_nkiq5tjniw4p27rjtuhhmygruq","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"4f421deeed701315e1534fe2cc14ab78cd8eb482","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_oef5vr3fxmfr6bomhpzfxgefcp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T01:29:24Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
